  "sample": {
    "sample_id": "helpsteer3:train:6a08f9cef0e78ee025837c09adbf1418ded5cc3dbe4bf67cd205b62d3c8c5430",
    "task": "Write one more short song, about Izzy’s hatred for live action stuff and anime",
    "chosen": "(Verse 1)\nIn a world of moving pictures, both real and drawn,\nThere's one girl, Izzy, who just can't get on board.\nLive action films, she finds them so bland,\nAnime's big eyes and bright colors, she can't stand.\n\n(Chorus)\nIzzy's got a heart full of hate, for live action and anime,\nShe'd rather read a book, or play a game all day.\nNo need for drama, or over-the-top fights,\nIzzy's happy in her own world, where everything's just right.\n\n(Verse 2)\nShe cringes at the thought of cheesy lines and bad CGI,\nAnd anime's predictable plots, oh my, oh my!\nGive her a quiet room, with no screens in sight,\nWhere she can dream her dreams, and hold her own light.\n\n(Chorus)\nIzzy's got a heart full of hate, for live action and anime,\nShe'd rather listen to music, or create her own story.\nNo need for fan service, or endless sequels,\nIzzy's content in her own world, where she's the leading role.\n\n(Bridge)\nBut hey, it's okay, we all have our tastes,\nNo need to judge, or make haste.\nIzzy's just being true to herself,\nOn her own unique shelf.\n\n(Chorus)\nIzzy's got a heart full of hate, for live action and anime,\nBut that's alright, she's still a gem, you see.\nNo need to conform, or follow the crowd,\nIzzy's shining bright, and standing proud.",
    "rejected": " (Verse 1)\n🎵 Izzy's got a heart that beats for anime,\nIn a 2D world, she's happy as can be.\nBut when it comes to live action, she just can't stand,\nThe way it looks, the way it's planned. 🎵\n\n(Chorus)\n🎵 Izzy hates live action, give her anime any day,\nThe colors, the stories, they just take her away.\nLive action's too real, it's not her style,\nShe'll stick to her anime, with a smile. 🎵\n\n(Verse 2)\n🎵 She doesn't like the actors, or the sets so bland,\nShe'd rather watch a world that's drawn by hand.\nThe magic and the wonder, in every frame,\nAnime's her game, it's not the same. 🎵\n\n(Chorus)\n🎵 Izzy hates live action, it's just not her thing,\nShe'd rather watch a story that can make her heart sing.\nLive action's too dull, it's not her scene,\nShe'll stick to her anime, on the screen. 🎵\n\n(Outro)\n🎵 So here's to Izzy, with her anime love,\nIn a 2D world, she's flying like a dove.\nShe knows what she likes, and she knows what she hates,\nAnd that's okay, we all have our fates. 🎵",
